      "message": "It looks like spi_flash_reg_to_protect() can fail if flash_get_status1/2 returns 0xFF (which would indicate a failure to read the status registers).  \n\nDoes it make sense to also return EC_FLASH_PROTECT_ERROR_INCONSISTENT for this case?  This type of failure is probably rare.",
